Like there are a lot of healthy paths.

00:09:23.283 --> 00:09:24.363
The other thing is that we know

00:09:24.363 --> 00:09:26.653
that people who are feeling burnt out,

00:09:26.653 --> 00:09:27.843
you know, if you're really in serious

00:09:27.843 --> 00:09:28.863
mental health dysfunction,

00:09:28.863 --> 00:09:31.473
like you're not gonna
be learning well, right?

00:09:31.473 --> 00:09:32.333
You know, when I look out

00:09:32.333 --> 00:09:33.553
at rates in college rates

00:09:33.553 --> 00:09:35.773
of depression at places like 40%

00:09:35.773 --> 00:09:37.183
