00:09:44.033 --> 00:09:46.613
You have to support your
mental health first.

00:09:46.613 --> 00:09:49.543
And then those academic
achievements come later.

00:09:49.543 --> 00:09:51.703
This is the thing that's
so shocking to students,

00:09:51.703 --> 00:09:53.243
but like the data, just bear this out.

00:09:53.243 --> 00:09:54.076
And in my class,

00:09:54.076 --> 00:09:56.623
I teach all about the
evidence of sleep for,

00:09:56.623 --> 00:09:57.963
for improving grades, right?

00:09:57.963 --> 00:09:58.963
Like just the act of sleep.

00:09:58.963 --> 00:10:00.703
It means you're gonna be more likely

00:10:00.703 --> 00:10:02.063
to get higher grades.

00:10:02.063 --> 00:10:03.603
And I have students who are like, okay,

00:10:03.603 --> 00:10:04.703
it's midterm season.

00:10:04.703 --> 00:10:06.343
This feels really counterintuitive to me.

00:10:06.343 --> 00:10:07.473
Normally I would stay up,

00:10:07.473 --> 00:10:09.642
like tons of hours and not get any sleep,

00:10:09.642 --> 00:10:10.707
but I'm gonna try it

00:10:10.707 --> 00:10:12.433
and then they would come
back to me afterwards

00:10:12.433 --> 00:10:14.083
and report like you are right.

00:10:14.083 --> 00:10:15.843
Like I did better on my midterms this year

00:10:15.843 --> 00:10:17.333
than I have in years.

00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:18.423
And I feel better, right?

00:10:18.423 --> 00:10:20.133
'Cause I'm not like super sleep deprived.

00:10:20.133 --> 00:10:23.233
And so I think it's a
matter of like overcoming

00:10:23.233 --> 00:10:24.553
these misconceptions we have.

00:10:24.553 --> 00:10:26.763
We think we need to be on full throttle,

00:10:26.763 --> 00:10:27.903
a hundred percent of the time

00:10:27.903 --> 00:10:29.893
and that's the way to get stuff done.

00:10:29.893 --> 00:10:33.593
But counter-intuitively
focusing on your wellbeing first

00:10:33.593 --> 00:10:36.063
might actually be a way to make
those grades, the accolades,

00:10:36.063 --> 00:10:37.873
all that stuff easier.

00:10:37.873 --> 00:10:39.423
And then you get both for free.

00:10:40.563 --> 00:10:43.243
- No, I can't reinforce
more of what you just said.

00:10:43.243 --> 00:10:46.053
You know, I had the
blessing of my first job

00:10:46.053 --> 00:10:46.886
