00:11:09.733 --> 00:11:12.423
The best thing you can do for your work

00:11:12.423 --> 00:11:14.483
is to go home and live your life,

00:11:14.483 --> 00:11:16.543
and not think about work for the next,

00:11:16.543 --> 00:11:19.360
whatever 12 hours or 16 hours.

00:11:19.360 --> 00:11:21.543
And it was kind of this
mind blowing thing to me,

00:11:21.543 --> 00:11:23.193
but he was right.

00:11:23.193 --> 00:11:25.273
I mean, he was a very successful investor.

00:11:25.273 --> 00:11:26.273
I learned a lot from him.

00:11:26.273 --> 00:11:27.703
It also created time and space for me

00:11:27.703 --> 00:11:29.223
to do things like Khan Academy.

00:11:29.223 --> 00:11:31.783
So I, you know, it completely resonates

00:11:31.783 --> 00:11:33.423
with what I, what I've heard.

00:11:33.423 --> 00:11:35.983
You know, actually 76 questions
actually was very similar

00:11:35.983 --> 00:11:36.816
