00:12:01.463 --> 00:12:03.603
you have all these responsibilities.

00:12:03.603 --> 00:12:04.436
And I think adults are,

00:12:04.436 --> 00:12:05.633
it's not just college students.

00:12:05.633 --> 00:12:08.073
I think adults are in the exact same boat.

00:12:08.073 --> 00:12:08.906
- No, totally.

00:12:08.906 --> 00:12:09.993
I mean, you know, it
