00:12:39.333 --> 00:12:40.166
The data is funny.

00:12:40.166 --> 00:12:42.803
It suggests the causal
arrow goes the opposite way.

00:12:42.803 --> 00:12:43.783
There's data, for example,

00:12:43.783 --> 00:12:47.153
that if you are in a more positive mood,

00:12:47.153 --> 00:12:49.223
