00:14:05.623 --> 00:14:07.903
a lot of the practices that really help.

00:14:07.903 --> 00:14:09.883
The good news is they
don't take a lot of time.

00:14:09.883 --> 00:14:11.633
And actually that's one of the other tips,

00:14:11.633 --> 00:14:15.322
is that a big predictor
of people feeling awful,

00:14:15.322 --> 00:14:18.993
like serious depression, is
people's level of time famine.

00:14:18.993 --> 00:14:21.223
So this feeling that you're
really hungry for time,

00:14:21.223 --> 00:14:23.313
you're just frantic
about time all the time.

00:14:23.313 --> 00:14:24.853
And what's amazing is that time famine

00:14:24.853 --> 00:14:26.223
the data suggests is going up,

00:14:26.223 --> 00:14:28.078
even though our free amount of time

00:14:28.078 --> 00:14:29.673
is actually going up to.

00:14:29.673 --> 00:14:30.683
It's like the perception

00:14:30.683 --> 00:14:32.453
