00:16:15.297 --> 00:16:17.083
for the people they care about.

00:16:17.083 --> 00:16:19.673
Even if it's just like 10,
15 minutes a day, you know.

00:16:19.673 --> 00:16:22.423
Yeah, you'll have less time
for school, that's okay.

00:16:22.423 --> 00:16:24.543
Like the priority is social connection.

00:16:24.543 --> 00:16:26.163
That would pay huge dividends

00:16:26.163 --> 00:16:28.033
where you're feeling a little
more socially connected,

00:16:28.033 --> 00:16:30.293
you get a little bit more
