00:16:30.293 --> 00:16:32.423
Like the problem is that
we have these priorities

00:16:32.423 --> 00:16:34.693
that might not be getting
us the things we want,

00:16:34.693 --> 00:16:36.693
including good grades, you know,

00:16:36.693 --> 00:16:38.513
the best jobs afterwards and so on.

00:16:38.513 --> 00:16:40.563
We might be going about it the wrong way.

00:16:41.743 --> 00:16:44.203
- No, that so resonates.

