00:17:16.303 --> 00:17:19.046
All of these tigers that
really aren't gonna eat me.

00:17:20.093 --> 00:17:22.133
And that frankly, I forget the next week.

00:17:22.133 --> 00:17:23.513
But if I just take a...

00:17:23.513 --> 00:17:25.773
I actually viewed as
my 30 minute vacation,

00:17:25.773 --> 00:17:27.063
I feel like I'm on the beach.

00:17:27.063 --> 00:17:28.713
Even though it's just in my head.

00:17:29.863 --> 00:17:32.213
That, Marcus Marshall really
is the famous Roman emperor

00:17:32.213 --> 00:17:33.046
and his meditations.

00:17:33.046 --> 00:17:33.879
He said, you know,

00:17:33.879 --> 00:17:35.293
"People wanna always say
they want to go to the beach

00:17:35.293 --> 00:17:36.443
or get away from it all."

